{"id":"ed1712b26584150e","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-ultraproduct.md","title":"Ultraproduct","display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-ultraproduct","aliases":["17-df-ultraproduct"],"display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[17-df-reduced-product]]","[[17-df-ultrafilter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; specialization of checked reduced-product construction","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"ultraproduct specialization of Definition 4.1.6","source_pages_print":[215,216],"source_pages_djvu":[231,232],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.2.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-ultraproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-ultraproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; specialization of checked reduced-product construction"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"ultraproduct specialization of Definition 4.1.6"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>231</span><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.2.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 是同一语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的超滤子，谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_D\">\\(\\sim_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_D\">\\([f]_D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P/{\\sim_D}\">\\(P/{\\sim_D}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a>；在本节点以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=U\">\\(D=U\\)</span> 实例化这些记号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in P\">\\(f\\in P\\)</span> 时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_U\">\\([f]_U\\)</span>。元理论及选择公理假设继承该构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构，以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.215（DjVu 231）将超积定义为滤子为超滤子时的归约积；模型解释按定义4.1.6，印刷 p.216。复用完整归约积结构可避免两个相同的商结构定义发生漂移。超滤子由定义已为真滤子，所以归约积的真滤子前提满足；商类及运算、关系和常元均沿用已明确声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=U\">\\(D=U\\)</span> 实例，而非只定义商集载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 是同一语言 $L$ 的结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子，谓词见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$、$P$、$\\sim_D$、$[f]_D$ 与 $P/{\\sim_D}$ 见 [[17-df-reduced-product]]；在本节点以 $D=U$ 实例化这些记号，$f\\in P$ 时使用 $[f]_U$。元理论及选择公理假设继承该构造。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构，以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 是同一语言 $L$ 的结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子，谓词见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$、$P$、$\\sim_D$、$[f]_D$ 与 $P/{\\sim_D}$ 见 [[17-df-reduced-product]]；在本节点以 $D=U$ 实例化这些记号，$f\\in P$ 时使用 $[f]_U$。元理论及选择公理假设继承该构造。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构，以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_D","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_D","display":false},{"tex":"P/{\\sim_D}","display":false},{"tex":"D=U","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).","display":true},{"tex":"D=U","display":false}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$。"},{"id":"3e71f70cb66ea186","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$ 及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。以下为唯一满足该谓词的结构引入 $\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U$ 记号；$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构。"},{"id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)$；其乘积载体 $P$ 和商类 $[f]_U$ 见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 为自由变量包含于 $\\{v_j:j<n\\}$ 的公式集，见 [[17-df-type]]；元组满足记号见 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar f\\in P^n$ 为代表元的有限元组。"},{"id":"76151855abd85b5f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$ (ultraproduct predicate, see [[17-df-ultraproduct]])"},{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作。$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为句子集；模型关系见 [[17-df-model]]。令 $I=\\{s\\subseteq T:|s|<\\aleph_0\\}$，并给定结构族 $(\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I}$，其中 $\\mathfrak A_s\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 且 $\\mathfrak A_s\\models s$。超积与超滤子接口见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]、[[17-thm-ultrafilter-extension]]；Łoś 定理见 [[17-thm-los]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]